# Usefulness: By applying a logarithmic transformation to 'nCp', we reduce the skewness of the feature distribution, as counts of terminal primary carbons may vary greatly on the molecular level. This helps models capture patterns on a more interpretable scale.
df['log_nCp'] = np.log1p(df['nCp'])
end

